	Dear Raph and fellow creative coders,

	implemented squircles, an evolution between squares and circles.
   Shapes have gradients and a hole to look through.
   They morph between their states circle and square

	Join the Birb's Nest Discord for friendly creative coding community
	and future challenges and contributions: https://discord.gg/S8c7qcjw2b
